      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Tough. DARK HARMONY (3) doesn't win often (none of these do) but is certainly up to it on his best. He struggled last week at Hamilton but a few runs earlier in the campaign in tougher company read nicely for this. Each-way up on speed. STATE OF MAINE (6) has been thereabouts in three runs back, just finding one better at Coleraine two back before a sound effort at Hamilton in this grade. Doubt she needs to do a whole lot more. MR CHARISMATIC (4) only has the 1 win from 17 but comes back a notch in grade here and can figure on best form. EIRE TO THE JUNGLE (1) is another on 1 from 17. The run three back at Moe is good enough to win this. GARGANTUAN (5) struggled at Naracoorte last time but is a hope on two runs prior.",
